## Argument Reference
The following arguments are supported:
- `domain` (Required, String): The domain name to be registered.
- `organization_id` - (Optional) The organization ID. If not provided, the default organization configured in the provider is used.
- `project_id` (Optional, String): The Scaleway project ID. If not provided, the default project id configured in the provider is used.
## Attributes Reference
In addition to all arguments above, the following attributes are exported:
- `id`: The domain name.
- `ns_servers`: List of NS servers for the domain once it is validated.

## Import

To import an existing external domain, use:

```bash
terraform import scaleway_domain_external_domain.example example.com
```